WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
[Soft ambient electronic music plays]
Speak turns your voice into useful writing in any Windows application.

00:06.000 --> 00:18.000
Press one shortcut and speak naturally. Record from anywhere, transcribe with your chosen engine, polish the result, and paste it into the active app.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
Browse saved local transcripts, search them, reopen the messages worth refining, and export when you choose.

00:28.000 --> 00:38.000
Teach Speak the names, products, technical terms, symbols, and preferred written forms you use.

00:38.000 --> 00:47.000
Review corrections, usage, accuracy signals, and progress without turning your writing habits into an advertising profile.

00:47.000 --> 00:54.000
Use separately configured local voice tools, preview outputs, and keep heavy models offloaded when idle.

00:54.000 --> 01:00.000
A planned $21 one-time launch offer will add an official supported build. Checkout is not open yet. The Apache-2.0 Community source stays open.
[Music fades]
